              "EZK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela mundu wa hachi ukaisigha hachi yake, na kubonya agho ghiko mawiwi karakara na uja mundu mmbiwi ubonyagha wuchafu, welee, uchakaia moyo? Hata! Ndekuwadie ilagho jingi ja hachi yake jichaakumbukwa; ela uchafwa kwa wundu ghwa wuwiwi na kaung'a uribonyere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Elaima sena mwaawuyaghamba ‘BWANA ndewuebonya hachi kungi.’ Sikirenyi idana inyo wandu wa Israeli, Loli siwuebonya hachi? Welee, si inyo mmbeni msewuebonya hachi anguwada? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji mundu wa hachi waghaluka na kuisigha hachi yake, na kubonya mawiwi uchafwa; mundu uo uchafwa kwa wundu ghwa ugho wuwiwi ghwake oreghubonyereghe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena mundu mmbiwi ukaghaluka kufuma kwa wuwiwi ghwake oreghubonyereghe na kubonya agho ghiko gha loli na gha hachi, uchakira irangi jake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia wacheemanya ukaghaluka kufuma kwa makosa ghake oreghibonyereghe; loli uchakaia moyo, ndechaafwa anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elaima sena wandu wa Israeli waawuyaghamba, ‘BWANA ndewuebonya hachi kungi.’ Si ini ungi nisewuebonya hachi, ela ni inyo msewuebonya hachi ee wandu wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa wundu ughu nichamtanya inyo ee wandu wa Israeli, kula umu onyu kunughana na mabonyo ghake, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba. Heenyi mghaluke, msighe makosa ghenyu, msechenoneka kwa wundu ghwa mawiwi ghenyu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sighenyi makosa ghenyu ghose m'bonyere aighu yapo, mmbuse ngolo mbishi na roho mbishi. Kwaki mfwagha ee wandu wa Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ini siboilwagha ni kifwa cha mndungi, ini Bwana MLUNGU naghamba; kwa huwo ghalukenyi mkaie moyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
